10. FACULTY CONTROL OVER JLPT REGISTRATION
==================================================

Faculty must have complete control over the student registration portal.

Create a section called:

JLPT REGISTRATION CONTROL CENTER.

Controls:

1. Enable registration.
2. Disable registration.
3. Open registration.
